## Private bindings

AI Council Notion database IDs and workspace hub URLs are intentionally
omitted from the public tree. Operators supply bindings at
`~/.config/cometweb/ai-council-notion.json` (or `$COMETWEB_CONFIG_HOME/…`),
optionally overridden by a gitignored `notion-bindings.local.json` in a clone.
